   <dc:title>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">PO_BGD_202009_0022</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:title>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">03 September 2020, Gaibandha, Bangladesh -Mst. Munni Akther (22) with six family members use to work for a local NGO. Now she jobless as the project is closed. She is the beneficiary of FAO silo distribution in flood emergency situation at Dokkhin Digholkandi, Holudia union 3. She said, this silo heled us a lot in flood situation, not only me everyone who received it from FAO. We were free from many diseases because we used to store safe water in it during flood. Now I don't have to keep water so I just keep rice and seeds.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
